name: a recorded session played to its end: /play 10 on the Broadcast channel (Zanor, 2026-10-21 17:47, the C# proxy's capture), six sector sessions, then the replay's own hand-off home
# Recording 10 (csharp/session_2026-10-21_174700, Net-7 through the C# proxy; its note: login, dock, land, gate,
# wormhole, prospect, kill mob, loot, fire weapon, use device to buff and to debuff): 6 sector sessions, 4674
# messages, each next one by the recording's own SERVER_HANDOFF: 1 sector 1070 (27 s), 2 sector 10701 (a
# starbase, 18 s), 3 sector 1070 (26 s), 4 sector 2210 (27 s), 5 sector 2295 (16 s), 6 sector 2210 (107 s); the
# last one's end antreplay answers with 'End of recording 10; back to Jupiter.' and a SERVER_HANDOFF home, whose
# connection answers START_ACK. No /stop: the playback runs to its completion (the user, 2026-11-14). About 260 s
# on retail and on ours (E1, 2026-11-14: both PASS; the packets the same but for a VERB_REQUEST / MASTER_JOIN
# order at two handoffs, as in play1_windows). Session 2's starbase needs Starbase_Avatar_ChangePacketClass's
# sending constructor 0x8A3600 (play9's fault).
# Camera poses (test-plan SP-01 / SP-02 first pass, 2026-11-25, R10): run with --camera-track (camera-track.txt).
# The server's CAMERA_CONTROL 5 (dock at Jove's Fury, session 1) puts the dock camera (state 6) in one place for
# about 0.7 s before the loading screen, the same place on every retail run; CAMERA_CONTROL 4 (the launchpad out of
# planet Endriago, sector 2295, session 5) comes 0.2 s before Net-7's handoff and the stargate camera (state 3)
# draws no frame; the warp camera of session 4 holds one place too. No event comes before either camera, and a
# shot on the handoff line is the loading screen (tried: both clients), so the track is the pose capture. The
# planet landing (session 4's end) was the recorded user's Land verb (ACTION 0x1D; that client ran no landing
# camera: ACTION 8 in the same ms), and on the replay the target panel's Land icon sends nothing; the take-off
# camera (state 9) is asked for by the warp button on a planet, which on Endriago's surface (CLIENT_TYPE 1, left by
# the launchpad gate) does nothing (key Q and a click, retail). Neither the landing (state 5 / 7) nor the take-off
# camera runs on this recording: they need a live run.
# Each sector's shot (2026-11-25, PH): the loading screen's fc_map_load00.ini is read when it opens (0.3 s before the
# session's LOGIN) and again when it closes (2.4-3.3 s after it; the first frame of the sector follows in the same
# 0.05 s), then the sector's files load for 1.4-5.8 s more (a 1 s quiet on the proxy's log), and a starbase logs
# 'Changing room from -1' about 5 s after the close (it logs no frame rate). The first 'Render: Frame Rate' after
# the session line was too early or too late: s2 waited past the starbase (no frame rate there) into session 3's
# space, s3 then matched at once, s4's first frame still had the camera of the sector before and s5's was black
# (R10's runs A-1 to A-4). The shots now wait for the close, the starbase's room, then the quiet.
timeout: 700
messages: on
include _login
key 0x08
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x8'
alive 1
text '/play 10'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'command "/play 10"' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 20
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 10, sector session 1 of 6' within 60
move 640,600
wait-event proxy 'ini.fc_map_load00[.]ini.*= ok' within 60
wait-quiet proxy 1 within 30
shot play10_s1
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 10, sector session 2 of 6' within 120
move 640,600
wait-event proxy 'ini.fc_map_load00[.]ini.*= ok' within 60
wait-event msg 'Sbase: .*Changing room from -1' within 30
wait-quiet proxy 1 within 30
shot play10_s2
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 10, sector session 3 of 6' within 120
move 640,600
wait-event proxy 'ini.fc_map_load00[.]ini.*= ok' within 60
wait-quiet proxy 1 within 30
shot play10_s3
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 10, sector session 4 of 6' within 200
move 640,600
wait-event proxy 'ini.fc_map_load00[.]ini.*= ok' within 60
wait-quiet proxy 1 within 30
shot play10_s4
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 10, sector session 5 of 6' within 200
move 640,600
wait-event proxy 'ini.fc_map_load00[.]ini.*= ok' within 60
wait-quiet proxy 1 within 30
shot play10_s5
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 10, sector session 6 of 6' within 200
move 640,600
wait-event proxy 'ini.fc_map_load00[.]ini.*= ok' within 60
wait-quiet proxy 1 within 30
shot play10_s6
wait-event antprox 'Playback of 10: end of the recording; back to' within 300
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF.*back to' within 10
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: received START_ACK' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 2 within 60
alive 8
shot play10_home
